OL,3,GNEWSAWait time for High Court trials
OL,4,Aset to triple by 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe wait time before people accused of
OL,7,Fthe most serious crimes in Scotland
OL,8,Fwill appear at a High Court trial is
OL,9,Fset to almost triple by 2028.
OL,11,FThe Scottish Courts and Tribunals
OL,12,FService (SCTS) forecasts that the
OL,13,Faverage wait after pleading diet ` when
OL,14,Fthe accused first appears at a hearing
OL,15,F` will increase from 50 weeks to 135
OL,16,Fweeks.
OL,18,FIt comes as the number of High Court
OL,19,Findictments served by the Crown Office
OL,20,Fis expected to exceed 2,700 this year,
OL,21,Fcompared to 935 in 2023/24.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
