OL,3,GNEWSAWait time for High Court trials
OL,4,Aset to triple by 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FSCTS said much of the case load is due
OL,7,Fto increased rates of prosecution of
OL,8,Fserious sexual offences, domestic abuse
OL,9,Fand organised crime.
